OL,3,GNEWSAFirst minister says Budget not
OL,4,Aserious about Wales ahead of meeting
OL,5,Awith PM
OL,6,
OL,7,FAndy Burnham's first Budget was "not
OL,8,Fserious about Wales", the country's
OL,9,Ffirst minister has said hours before
OL,10,Fhis meeting with the prime minister.
OL,12,FRhun ap Iorwerth is joining Scottish
OL,13,FFirst Minister John Swinney in Glasgow
OL,14,Fon Friday for a National Economic
OL,15,FCouncil meeting.
OL,17,FThe first minister said Chancellor John
OL,18,FHealey's funding package offered
OL,19,F"paltry" sums for rail and cuts for
OL,20,FWelsh public services.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
